Commit:     Codex <codex@openai.com>
CommitDate: Sun Nov 15 22:29:51 2026 -0500

    iio: integrate qualified IADC, MPU6515 DMP and precision ports
    
    Bring the signed IADC conversion, MPU offset/PM prerequisites, tiny scale
    formatter and guarded DMP stream/SMD lifecycle from IIO source
    0cf9669f4e6aefaaba2c0b5798a2306f7cc72dfc. Preserve all previous board,
    clock, display, camera, power, input and transport work.
    
    Both native Qualcomm profiles compile 18 relevant objects with W=1 and
    no diagnostics. Actual-source host models pass and the six DMP programs
    match the maintainer source byte for byte. This is not a linked kernel,
    package, boot or physical hardware acceptance.
    
    Original feature authorship remains in the eight-commit source series.
    Integration and qualification used OpenAI Codex assistance.

